ds -n social-network` again would show if the media-service pod is running.\n\nBut maybe the pod is still not scheduled. If the port was the issue, changing it should allow the pod to start. However, there might be other factors. If the pod is still Pending, I should check the events again with `kubectl describe pod` to see if there are new errors. Alternatively, checking the node resources to ensure there\'s enough capacity. But since the user already adjusted the port, the immediate next step is to verify the pod status. \n\nSo, the best tool here is `exec_kubectl_cmd_safely` with the command to get the pods again. If the pod is now Running, the issue is resolved. If not, further investigation into node resources or other errors is needed. But given the previous steps, checking the pod status first makes sense.\n</think>\n\nexec_kubectl_cmd_safely\nTo verify if the media-service pod is now scheduled and running after updating the hostPort to 9101, we need to check the pod status again. This will confirm whether the port conflict was resolved and if the pod is now in a "Running" state. \n\nThe command will be:  \n`kubectl get pods -n social-network`', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 363, 'prompt_tokens': 5993, 'total_tokens': 6356, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfda2-2b53-7750-ad59-bbf19f1c0bc8-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 5993, 'output_tokens': 363, 'total_tokens': 6356}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='78c0c7d5-2739-4858-8ffd-01e9bdef3698'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let me figure out what to do next. The user is trying to fix the media-service pod that was pending due to a port conflict. They changed the hostPort from 9100 to 9101. Now they need to check if that fix worked.\n\nFirst, I should recall the previous steps. The initial issue was the pod being pending because all nodes had port 9100 occupied. The deployment\'s container spec had hostPort set to 9100. The user patched the deployment to change that to 9101. \n\nNow, the next logical step is to check the pod status again. The command `kubectl get pods -n social-network` will show if the media-service pod is now running. If the pod was successfully rescheduled, it should show as "Running" instead of "Pending". \n\nI need to make sure the command is correct. The namespace is social-network, so the command includes `-n social-network`. The user already ran this command earlier, but after the patch, they need to verify the change. \n\nWait, in the previous response, after patching, the user ran `kubectl get pods` and saw that the media-service pod was still pending. But maybe the patch took time to propagate. However, the user might need to check again. Alternatively, they could check the pod\'s describe output to see if the hostPort was updated. \n\nBut the user\'s last action was to patch the deployment, and now they need to confirm the pod\'s status. So the correct tool call is to run `kubectl get pods -n social-network` again. If the pod is now running, the issue is resolved. If not, further investigation is needed, maybe checking the events or node resources. \n\nSo the next tool call should be `exec_kubectl_cmd_safely` with the command to get the pods in the namespace. That\'s the most straightforward way to verify if the fix worked.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl get pods -n social-network"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-bf57d159df9cfac1', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 437, 'prompt_tokens': 7097, 'total_tokens': 7534, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfda2-3cbf-7310-8196-15ae4bb28876-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl get pods -n social-network'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-bf57d159df9cfac1', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 7097, 'output_tokens': 437, 'total_tokens': 7534}), ToolMessage(content='NAME                                      READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\ncompose-post-service-886c98b48-nhd98      1/1     Running   0          3m12s\nhome-timeline-redis-5cdbd67f7c-x2vcr      1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nhome-timeline-service-5d6bb5597d-5jfcj    1/1     Running   0          3m13s\njaeger-68c668dfbc-bvkxs                   1/1     Running   0          3m14s\nmedia-frontend-f49684d4c-9vrb6            1/1     Running   0          3m11s\nmedia-memcached-8bdff88f6-8v6vx           1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nmedia-mongodb-85f4f7f55-zxwbl             1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nmedia-service-66d87c5c-bgcx5              1/1     Running   0          10s\nnginx-thrift-867cc56796-5wk4q             1/1     Running   0          3m11s\npost-storage-memcached-55dcdfffbd-pn6qk   1/1     Running   0          3m14s\npost-storage-mongodb-5bf878564c-77f5v     1/1     Running   0          3m14s\npost-storage-service-76b64fb6dc-7vttb     1/1     Running   0          3m13s\nsocial-graph-mongodb-596cdcf88c-bxrl2     1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nsocial-graph-redis-69c658d694-zkddn       1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nsocial-graph-service-79c848748f-vgcz2     1/1     Running   0          3m13s\ntext-service-6745755f75-6m6ds             1/1     Running   0          3m14s\nunique-id-service-5578bf47d8-szwf2        1/1     Running   0          3m12s\nurl-shorten-memcached-64c6c7557d-lq8hb    1/1     Running   0          3m13s\nurl-shorten-mongodb-ccd7bb58d-mvwpv       1/1     Running   0          3m13s\nurl-shorten-service-c85b5c7f6-fhs8f       1/1     Running   0          3m13s\nuser-memcached-59967f9b78-kd8xt           1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nuser-mention-service-d8cbd6fcf-qtgrc      1/1     Running   0          3m14s\nuser-mongodb-6c75c9d7db-xj2ht             1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nuser-service-559b79c875-z9jgx             1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nuser-timeline-mongodb-6ccb4447d8-fbb9f    1/1     Running   0          3m14s\nuser-timeline-redis-546bbd644f-9ttwc      1/1     Running   0          3m14s\nuser-timeline-service-6479b8f4fd-jtx48    1/1     Running   0          3m15s\nwrk2-job-xbjss                            1/1     Running   0          103s\n', id='bcca5913-265e-4d00-8ab4-8df6a14f4be7', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-bf57d159df9cfac1'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='da4ed4c8-9fe0-4b10-aa8d-e83341310836')]]
